:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Gentleman Bros. (Enemy)]].''
'''Evil Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by chance when beating any stage in [[Ritual Happiness (Monthly Event)|Ritual Happiness]]. It was added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.2 Update|Version 2.1.2]]. This unit is a variant of [[Zombie Cat (Special Cat)|Zombie Cat]] that freezes [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies instead of being strong against them. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]] decreases its cost, gains [[Barrier Breaker]] and increases its chance to stop Red enemies. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Evil Cat can be unlocked once in the [[Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] from Chapter One.

